OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new submarines expected to
OL,4,Astart next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has confirmed work is
OL,7,Fexpected to start next year on
OL,8,Fsubmarines to be built in England as
OL,9,Fpart the Aukus deal between the UK, US
OL,10,Fand Australia.
OL,12,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,13,Freiterated they would be manufactured
OL,14,Fby BAE Systems in Barrow-in-Furness,
OL,15,FCumbria, and steel cutting should begin
OL,16,Fin 2027, marking the start of
OL,17,Fproduction and with the first coming
OL,18,Finto service in the late 2030s.
OL,20,FThey will replace the Astute class
OL,21,Fsubmarines, the seventh and last of
OL,22,Fwhich is being built in Barrow now.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
